-- migrations ONLY (the v6.28.x seed build base, then this app's migrations at `next`). Push result:
-- 2 created, 96 updated, 223 unchanged, 0 errors.
--
-- CREATED: the queries "Sales: Party Lookup Promotable Accounts" and "Sales: Party Lookup
-- Promotable Contacts" (category Sales), each with 3 fields (ID, Name, Detail), 2 parameters
-- (Term, Domain) and 2 query entities, and their approved fingerprints (set only while the query
-- has none).
--
-- UPDATED: Sales Contacts' FirstName field gets IsNameField = 0 and AutoUpdateIsNameField = 0
-- (metadata/entity-fields/.sales-contact-name-field.json). Without it CodeGen can flag FirstName as
-- a second name field when it adds fields to Sales Contacts, and every denormalized contact-name
-- column then shows a bare first name instead of DisplayNameAndEmail. The push wrote only
-- AutoUpdateIsNameField because the build database already had IsNameField = 0; IsNameField is
-- added by hand so a host where CodeGen already flagged FirstName does not keep the flag with
-- auto-update off. The field's ID is resolved by entity name + field name.
--
-- CREATE-ONLY: each create is guarded on its ID or its key (query on CategoryID + Name; fields and
-- parameters on QueryID + Name; query entities on QueryID + EntityID), and the push log's update
-- branches are cut, so a host that already has a query keeps its own copy.
--
-- LEFT OUT: the push's last two updates, which set each query's ExtractionStatus to Warning
-- because the build database had no AI credentials for the field-description pass.
--
-- SOURCE FIELDS: each query field's SourceEntityFieldID is resolved on the target database from its
-- SourceEntityID and SourceFieldName (the shipped ID first); NULL when no such field exists.
--
-- CATEGORY: each query's category resolves to this app's Sales category, its ID first and then by
-- name, not by name alone: a database can hold more than one category named Sales.
--
-- TRANSFORMS: `[${mjSchema}].` -> `[${mjSchema}].` on the SP calls and lookups. Idempotent.
-- =============================================================================================

